abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. For every maximum degree Delta >= 3, the hard-core model at every activity up to the uniqueness threshold has l-infinity spectral independence O(sqrt(n) log n) on every n-vertex graph of maximum degree at most Delta, under all pinnings, with an explicit constant. Lean proofs are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
